      <link>https://m.zhibo8.com//news/web/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a9750e8a97fdnative.htm</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【恩佐加盟曼城】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a96f5b3063aanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">夏窗标王！官方：曼城签下25岁切尔西中场恩佐，转会费1.25亿英镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020004386222.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020004386222.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020004386222.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，曼城签下切尔西中场恩佐。此前据罗马诺和多家媒体报道，恩佐加盟曼城的转会费为1.25亿英镑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a9753605f907native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">加盟曼城！恩佐：曼城是英格兰近年来最成功球队，自豪能成为一员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020637003670.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020637003670_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020637003670_720.jpg"> </div><p>曼城官方宣布，正式签下切尔西中场恩佐·费尔南德斯。加盟后，恩佐接受了俱乐部官方采访。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a974822a20c4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">恩佐长文告别切尔西：不得不做出一个艰难决定，一日蓝军终生蓝军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.52" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020549414885.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.52" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.52" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020549414885_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020549414885_720.jpg"> </div><p>据多方媒体报道，曼城已经完成了从切尔西签下恩佐的交易，转会费1.25亿英镑。恩佐在个人社交媒体发文，向切尔西告别。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a9753d79ac9fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大换血！曼城夏窗出售罗德里，豪掷3.75亿欧买恩佐+布阿迪+安德森</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260901/202609012357499303.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260901/202609012357499303_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260901/202609012357499303_720.jpg"> </div><p>曼城今夏出售罗德里、尼科·冈萨雷斯、赖因德斯，又花费超3.75亿欧元总价购买恩佐（1.45亿欧）、布阿迪（9500万欧）、埃利奥特·安德森（1.35亿欧），完成中场重建工作。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a96f82519e93native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大幅刷新纪录！跟队：蓝军今夏卖人已近5亿欧，此前最高纪录3.5亿</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/6a8d47cd5693d_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/6a8d47cd5693d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/6a8d47cd5693d.jpg"> </div><p>曼城签下切尔西中场恩佐，转会费超过1.25亿英镑（约1.45亿欧）。蓝军跟队金塞拉发文，表示蓝军已经再次打破单个窗口的卖人纪录。</p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a974bf45cf8bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">多名记者：卡马拉转会切尔西告吹！此前罗马诺已5500万欧HWG</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a974cbe53528native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWBack！罗马诺：摩纳哥达协议又取消卡马拉交易，切尔西非常愤怒</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.95" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260902/202609020430183145.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.95" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.95" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260902/202609020430183145.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260902/202609020430183145.jpg"> </div><p>蓝军跟队金塞拉等多名记者确认，卡马拉转会切尔西告吹！此前，记者罗马诺已经以here we go确认，切尔西以5500万欧签下卡马拉。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a974e988a312native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">多家媒体：蓝军得知卡马拉告吹后本能阻止恩佐转会，但仍选择守约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d75b393c3bc.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.25" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.25" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d75b393c3bc.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d75b393c3bc.jpg"> </div><p>切尔西引进摩纳哥中场卡马拉告吹后，包括跟队记者金塞拉在内的多名记者跟进报道，表示切尔西在得知摩纳哥态度反转后，本有机会阻止恩佐今晚转会曼城，但他们选择信守承诺。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a9756dac9aa8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">诚信蓝军！截止日时间线：放行恩佐→签卡马拉告吹→恩佐仍转会</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020651105346_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020651105346_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020651105346_720.jpg"> </div><p>切尔西签卡马拉一事，在已经here we go后宣告交易告吹。多家媒体报道，在已经达成书面协议的情况下，摩纳哥单方面反悔导致交易关闭。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a972f12397bcnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：曼城签下埃弗顿边锋恩迪亚耶，转会费总价6500万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020403076480.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020403076480_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020403076480_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，曼城签下埃弗顿边锋恩迪亚耶，双方签约5年。据此前记者罗马诺报道，转会费总价6500万镑（约7580万欧）。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a973cf55a3d9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：热刺从切尔西租借穆德里克，买断选项7500万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020501307459.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020501307459_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020501307459_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，热刺从切尔西租借穆德里克。据罗马诺报道，买断选项为7500万镑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a970e2fd903cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：尤文签下沃尔特马德，租借费达350万镑且没有买断选项</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020143051528.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020143051528_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020143051528_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，尤文签下沃尔特马德，球员租借加盟，没有买断选项。租借费用280万欧，附加费80万欧，另有最高可达50万欧的浮动奖金。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-02/6a9713